{"slug":"cli-handbook","title":"Barkpark `bp` CLI — Handbook (M4 GA)","blocks":[
{"id":"b1","type":"ingress","content":[{"type":"text","value":"The same Go binary is the interactive TUI (no args) and the CLI (with a command), with a command tree that is a pure function of "},{"type":"text","value":"GET /v1/capabilities","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},
{"id":"b2","type":"callout","tone":"info","content":[{"type":"text","value":"The same Go binary is the interactive TUI (no args) and the CLI (with a command). Source: "},{"type":"text","value":"internal/cli/","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"text","value":"internal/manifest/","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":". Frozen contracts: "},{"type":"text","value":"docs/cli/manifest.schema.json","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", the M0 decisions doc, and the error-exit table."}]},
{"id":"b3","type":"divider"},
{"id":"b4","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Install & upgrade"},
{"id":"b5","type":"code","value":"curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/FRIKKern/barkpark/main/scripts/install-cli.sh | sh\nbp version   # -> barkpark <version>"},
{"id":"b6","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Detects OS ("},{"type":"text","value":"darwin","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"text","value":"linux","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":") + arch ("},{"type":"text","value":"arm64","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"text","value":"amd64","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"), installs to "},{"type":"text","value":"/usr/local/bin","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" (fallback "},{"type":"text","value":"~/.local/bin","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"), sha256-verifies against the release's "},{"type":"text","value":"checksums.txt","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":". Wizard walkthrough: the QUICKSTART setup doc."}]},
{"id":"b7","type":"table","head":[
[{"type":"text","value":"Env"}],
[{"type":"text","value":"Effect"}]
],"rows":[
[[{"type":"text","value":"BARKPARK_CLI_VERSION","marks":["code"]}],[{"type":"text","value":"pin a release, e.g. "},{"type":"text","value":"1.0.1","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" (installer only)"}]],
[[{"type":"text","value":"BARKPARK_CLI_RELEASE_BASE","marks":["code"]}],[{"type":"text","value":"mirror override — asset DIR for the installer, release-tree ROOT for "},{"type":"text","value":"bp upgrade","marks":["code"]}]],
[[{"type":"text","value":"BARKPARK_BIN_DIR","marks":["code"]}],[{"type":"text","value":"install dir"}]]
]},
{"id":"b8","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"bp upgrade","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" self-updates from the latest "},{"type":"text","value":"cli-v*","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" GitHub release: redirect-based latest detection (no API), sha256-verified, atomic same-dir rename; refuses on "},{"type":"text","value":"dev","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" builds; on EACCES prints the sudo re-install one-liner. "},{"type":"text","value":"bp upgrade --check","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" prints current vs latest — exit 1 when behind."}]},
{"id":"b9","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Release runbook:","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" tag "},{"type":"text","value":"cli-vX.Y.Z","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" → the "},{"type":"text","value":"cli-release","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" workflow runs "},{"type":"text","value":"go test","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", cross-compiles 4 binaries + "},{"type":"text","value":"checksums.txt","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", publishes the GitHub Release (hyphenated versions get "},{"type":"text","value":"--prerelease","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", which "},{"type":"text","value":"releases/latest","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" skips). Re-cut a botched release via workflow_dispatch with the tag. "},{"type":"text","value":"cli-v*","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" owns "},{"type":"text","value":"releases/latest","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" — the npm pipeline's "},{"type":"text","value":"v1.*","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" tags create no GitHub Releases; keep it that way."}]},
{"id":"b10","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Grammar"},
{"id":"b11","type":"code","value":"bp [global flags] <noun> <verb> [args] [command flags]"},
{"id":"b12","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Command tree is a "},{"type":"text","value":"pure function","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" of "},{"type":"text","value":"GET /v1/capabilities","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" — plugins add noun/verb with zero client code change."}]},
{"id":"b13","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Context precedence"},
{"id":"b14","type":"code","value":"flags  >  env (BARKPARK_*)  >  active context  >  defaults"},
{"id":"b15","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Source: "},{"type":"text","value":"manifest.Resolve","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":". Active context is persisted "},{"type":"text","value":"config.json","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" ("},{"type":"text","value":"bp setup","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"text","value":"bp use <name>","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":")."}]},
{"id":"b16","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Auth tiers"},
{"id":"b17","type":"table","head":[
[{"type":"text","value":"auth_tier","marks":["code"]}],
[{"type":"text","value":"What the CLI sends"}]
],"rows":[
[[{"type":"text","value":"none","marks":["code"]}],[{"type":"text","value":"nothing"}]],
[[{"type":"text","value":"read","marks":["code"]}],[{"type":"text","value":"bearer only when path is scoped"}]],
[[{"type":"text","value":"write","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"text","value":"admin","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"text","value":"scoped_admin","marks":["code"]}],[{"type":"text","value":"Authorization: Bearer <token>","marks":["code"]}]],
[[{"type":"text","value":"ingest","marks":["code"]}],[{"type":"text","value":"Authorization: Bearer <secret>","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" (reads "},{"type":"text","value":"BARKPARK_INGEST_TOKEN","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" → bearer fallback)"}]]
]},
{"id":"b18","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"scoped_admin","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" is never client-refused","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" (M0 contract rule #2) — the server's 403 is surfaced cleanly."}]},
